 4. 🕔 After hours: Kevin! 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Macaulay Culkin walks the red carpet during the 78th Emmy Awards in Los Angeles on Sept. 14. Photo: Allen J. Schaben / Los Angeles Times via Getty Images

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 If you're thirsty for more " Home Alone," you've waited long enough. 

 Macaulay Culkin is working with Disney's 20th Century Studios to develop a "Home Alone" sequel, Deadline reports . 🍿 State of play: This comes after Culkin recently floated an idea for a new film in the franchise in which his Kevin McCallister would be a dad locked out of the house by his son, who's setting traps for him.

 Seth Rogen and Evan Goldberg are reportedly writing and producing the project in partnership with Culkin, according to Deadline. It's unclear whether they're going with Culkin's original idea or something else. 💭 Nathan's thought bubble: Listen, might it be terrible? Yes. Will I be first in line to see it? Also yes. Bring on the nostalgia.

 
 
